            "providerContent": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Alberto has built three AI agents:\n\n1. **Fraud Detection Agent** (offline-evals): Reviews events and organizers on a ticketing platform, recommending approve/reject/request-info with reasons. It auto-approves only on code-verified evidence; web sources can hold decisions but never approve. Offline evals show significant fraud reduction improvements.\n\n2. **Organizer Support Agent** (coming-soon): Answers event organizers' questions about sales, payouts and setup without human review, pulling live data from PostgreSQL and the payments API.\n\n3. **Portfolio Agent** (personal-project): Answers visitors' questions about Alberto's experience and projects in natural language on his portfolio site, also exposed as an MCP server for external agents to query."
